; Cloudflare BIND import for adhikram.com → GitHub Pages
; Repo: Adhikram/portfolio
;
; Before import:
;   1. Delete the two A records on adhikram.com (13.248.243.5 and 76.223.105.230).
;   2. Delete the www CNAME (currently points at adhikram.com).
; Leave Mailgun MX/TXT/DKIM, email CNAME, and _domainconnect as they are.
; After import: every new record must stay DNS only (grey cloud), not Proxied.

$ORIGIN adhikram.com.
$TTL 3600

@ IN A 185.199.108.153
@ IN A 185.199.109.153
@ IN A 185.199.110.153
@ IN A 185.199.111.153

@ IN AAAA 2606:50c0:8000::153
@ IN AAAA 2606:50c0:8001::153
@ IN AAAA 2606:50c0:8002::153
@ IN AAAA 2606:50c0:8003::153

www IN CNAME Adhikram.github.io.
